    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -16,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "えっとね。今日はわたし、バスケ部の練習もないし暇だから商店街の甘味処を巡ってたんだよね。冬の新作、まだチェックしてなかったし"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -16,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "flower",
    "position": {
      "x": -16,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "今年は豊作でね、どこも目移りするような最高のスイーツを並べてたの。わたし嬉しくなって、つい食べ過ぎちゃってね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/angry1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -16,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/56/emo_puzzle-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "……えっ、『太りますよ』って？　それ禁句だってば、君はわたしに酷いことを言ったりしない子だと思ってたんだけどなぁ？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -16,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "ともあれ。このお店でも、ケーキとか二十個ぐらい食べたんだ。それでだいぶ満足してたんだけど、お財布のなかみが『からっぽ』になってることに気づいてさ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/sad2",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -16,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "disappointed",
    "position": {
      "x": -16,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "青ざめたよ。ほんと食べ過ぎちゃった、後悔してる。冬は脂肪が溜まりやすいのにな～……。いいけどさ、またバイトを探さないと金欠だよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
